      "id": "dspi",
      "name": "DSIP (Delta Sleep-Inducing Peptide)",
      "aliases": [
        "DSPI (Delta sleep inducing peptide)",
        "DSPI",
        "DSIP",
        "Emideltide"
      ],
      "kind": "product",
      "identityStatus": "resolved",
      "categoryID": 5,
      "benefits": "Investigational sleep and recovery benefits: studied for slow-wave (delta) sleep and sleep architecture, with proposed roles in cortisol and stress modulation, pain relief and recovery. DSIP is described as a neuromodulator rather than a conventional sedative. Human sleep results are small and mixed; reliable restorative sleep, chronic-pain relief and freedom from daytime drowsiness or dependence are not firmly established. Findings from intravenous studies do not establish benefits for every administration method."
    }
  ],
